description: Use only absolute @/ import paths
globs: "**/*.{ts,tsx}"
alwaysApply: false
---

# Absolute imports

Use only absolute imports via the `@/` alias. Do not use relative paths (`./` or `../`).

```tsx
// BAD
import { ThemeHotkey } from "./components/ThemeHotkey/ThemeHotkey"
import { UserName } from "../UserName/UserName"

// GOOD
import TelegramColorSchemeSync from "@/components/providers/TelegramProvider/components/TelegramColorSchemeSync/TelegramColorSchemeSync"
import UserName from "@/app/UserGreeting/components/UserName/UserName"
```
